title: The Council
subtitle: Change the advisors you are listening to.
is-pinned-card: true
card-image: img/cards/council.svg?v=2
tags: advisor
new-page: true
view-if: adv_reserve >= 1 and council_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.syncAdvisors(Q);
!}

= The Council

You listen to four advisors at a time; the others wait in the corridor. Changing the council takes a turn, and it cannot be done again for three months.

*Advising now: [+ council_list +].* *In reserve: [+ reserve_list +].*

- @shuffle: Draw a new council at random.
- @bring_martov: Call on Julius Martov. (The longest-serving advisor steps down.)
- @bring_dan: Call on Fyodor Dan. (The longest-serving advisor steps down.)
- @bring_tsereteli: Call on Irakli Tsereteli. (The longest-serving advisor steps down.)
- @bring_chkheidze: Call on Nikolai Chkheidze. (The longest-serving advisor steps down.)
- @bring_skobelev: Call on Matvei Skobelev. (The longest-serving advisor steps down.)
- @bring_gvozdev: Call on Kuzma Gvozdev. (The longest-serving advisor steps down.)
- @bring_potresov: Call on Alexander Potresov. (The longest-serving advisor steps down.)
- @bring_axelrod: Call on Pavel Axelrod. (The longest-serving advisor steps down.)
