@shuffle
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1; Q.council_timer = 3;
RO.reshuffleCouncil(Q);
!}

The advisors were thanked and sent home, and a new circle was called together.

- @root: Continue.

@bring_martov
view-if: avail_martov = 1 and on_martov = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1; Q.council_timer = 3;
RO.callAdvisor(Q, 'martov');
!}

Julius Martov has been called to the council. The one who had served longest has gone back to the party's work.

- @root: Continue.

